# AgriBioTech Frontend Production Configuration
# In production on Vercel, set VITE_API_URL in Project Settings -> Environment Variables
# Example: https://agribiotech-api.vercel.app or https://agribiotech-backend.onrender.com
# When left empty during local development, Vite proxies /api to http://localhost:5000 automatically.
VITE_API_URL=
